[Quotes]


victory01 = "Get lost."
victory02 = "Without strength, you have nothing."
victory03 = "It's over."
victory04 = "Might controls all."
victory05 = "Justice prevails."
victory06 = "I guess this was your best shot."
victory07 = "I should've let Dyspo handle this."
victory08 = "With all your strength, you still failed."
victory09 = "... Walk away."
victory10 = "Whatever is beyond strength... I shall attain it."

victory11 = "Your strength... its arrogance is its downfall."
victory12 = "If fate wishes us destroyed then so be it."
victory13 = "It ends in fire."
victory14 = "Lord Vermoud, was it worth it?"
victory15 = "What? No, I have no interest in your leader."
victory16 = "You lack the strength to face me."
victory17 = "You are not worthy of my time."
victory18 = "Is this your determination?"
victory19 = "Begone."
victory20 = "I respect your strength. We should hold a bout again, once you're healed."

victory21 = "Remember this fist."
victory22 = "I remain unmoved by your plight."
victory23 = "You have faced no tempest, no deprivation, you want for nothing and you come before me holding your bravery in your fists..."
victory24 = "Why do you fight?"
victory25 = "Warrior, sleep."
victory26 = "One punch? I wouldn't stop at one."
victory27 = "No more tricks under your sleeve? Time manipulation, speed, pyrokinetics?"
victory28 = "Your soul is like that of a baby, crying at its own weakness."
victory29 = "Friendship is easily destroyed... just like your body."
victory30 = "There isn't a speck of purity in the self-righteous way you fight."

victory31 = "Was this all that you strived for?"
victory32 = "If your Gods stand in my way, I'll topple them as well."
victory33 = "Do you think the Gods look from above in fear of what they've created?"
victory34 = "Exploiting weaknesses is not true strength!"
victory35 = "This is my overwhelming fist. The strength of the just."
victory36 = "True power is born out of sacrifice."
victory37 = "But, what lies beyond this victory?"
victory38 = "Even if the energy of the gods might permeate your muscles, I'll grind you down."
victory39 = "One more battle, one more brick in the temple of your soul."
victory40 = "There is strength behind your eyes... Next time make sure it's behind your fists as well."

victory41 = "I have no need for allies. Limp away."
victory42 = "This is the apex of strenght, you might not enjoy it, but this is what it looks like."
victory43 = "Strength carried by love and friendship sounds awfully precarious to me."
victory44 = "Impressive as your strength might be, remember that the universe is a large place and someone larger than you lurks around the corner."
victory45 = "I've measured your brawn and found it to be wanting."
victory46 = "Why do your strikes feel so weak?"
victory47 = "Did a dragon put you up to this?"
victory48 = "You people rely too much on wishing Dragons."